e=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>新<rt>あたら</rt></ruby>しいコールが<ruby>出来<rt>でき</rt></ruby>て<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいねってメンバーと<ruby>話<rt>はな</rt></ruby>してました✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>皆<rt>みな</rt></ruby>さん<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>ってくれてありがとうございます！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しかった🐰💕</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-07-01/25570_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0736.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);